      <div class="step reveal d2"><span class="num serif">03</span><h3 class="serif">Select</h3><p>Choose a preset, set the timer and tap start — then let go.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal d3"><span class="num serif">04</span><h3 class="serif">Pour</h3><p>In about twenty seconds, pour a smooth, foamy bowl and enjoy the calm.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:48px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pages/how-it-works">See the full method &rarr;</a></p>
